    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d426">

                <pb facs="0671" n="559" sameAs="frus:frus1907p1/pg559"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 4001/7.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Governor of Jamaica to the Secretary of
                    State</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Jamaica</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1907-01-20"><hi rendition="#italic">January 20,
                        1907</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Jamaica profoundly grateful to your excellency for expression of sympathy and for
                    the very practical aid so kindly given by Admiral Davis and the entire
                    particular service squadron of the United States Navy.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Governor.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
